              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Guard Ghulams may have heavy armour (+1), thrusting spear (+3) and cloth barding (+3). They are Veteran and may be Drilled (+2) and Stubborn (+3).</characteristic>
